      "writtenOn": "2026-06-04T14:41:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In Jetty 9 the default `blockingTimeout` was `-1`, not `0`, that\u0027s why we need to change the setting.\n\nCan you point to the place in Jetty 12 where it says that the default is using `idleTimeout`?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 471,
        "startChar": 32,
        "endLine": 472,
        "endChar": 26
      },
      "revId": "dcb1e7bf94f42f73de30f7a0e86b52ef2d227466",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "afd8554f_af09faa9",
