        "id": 1011323
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-06-05T05:47:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You\u0027re right about the precision. Jetty 9\u0027s default for blockingTimeout was -1 (blocking-timeout disabled); the setBlockingTimeout(0) call was Gerrit explicitly opting into Jetty 9\u0027s special \"0 \u003d\u003d use idle timeout\" semantic. Rewording the TODO to make that distinction explicit and to avoid the unverified \"Jetty 12 default\" claim.",
      "parentUuid": "27b2b89d_b6db3063",
